# GitHub Actions secret — set in repo Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions,
# NOT copied into .env:
#   https://github.com/jbaruch/agentic-context-registry/settings/secrets/actions
# FLEET_DISPATCH_TOKEN — the token .github/workflows/review-trigger.yml reads to start the
#   review run in jbaruch/coding-policy. Create it with Actions: Read and write on
#   jbaruch/coding-policy.
FLEET_DISPATCH_TOKEN=
# HOMEBREW_TAP_DEPLOY_KEY — the release workflow uses this repository-scoped write
#   key to update jbaruch/homebrew-agentic-context-registry. Create it with
#   scripts/provision-tap-deploy-key.sh;
#   rotate it with scripts/provision-tap-deploy-key.sh --rotate.
HOMEBREW_TAP_DEPLOY_KEY=
# CODEX_API_KEY — an OpenAI API key the dispatch-only .github/workflows/codex-live.yml
#   forwards to the Codex CLI for a real semantic conversion. It never reaches
#   pull-request runs. Locally, `acr migrate tessl-plugin --agent codex` uses the
#   account from `codex login` instead; set this only for a noninteractive run.
CODEX_API_KEY=
